<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36964" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pōmĭfer</span></b> ,
			ĕra, ĕrum, adj.
		pomum-fero, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>fruit-bearing</i>, <i>fruit-bringing</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in post-Aug.
			prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arbor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					12, 3, 7, § 15</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 2, 1</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rami,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Herc. Fur. 700</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">auctumnus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 4, 7, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">annus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 3, 23, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lignum,</span>”
				<i>tree</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Gen. 1, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">SVLVANVS,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Murat. 70, 6</span></i>
			.—Hence, <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pōmĭ-ferae</span></b> ,
				ārum, f., <i>fruit-trees</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 17, 27, 43, §
		253</span></i>.</div>
